 python3-waitress (>= 2.0),
 iptables,
 nftables
Recommends: systemd
Description: local web console for the Linux firewall
 View and manage nftables and IPv4/IPv6 iptables rules, configure masquerading,
 save backups, and explicitly configure boot-time persistence. Firewall
 modifications require root with CAP_NET_ADMIN; without it, the authenticated
 web interface runs read-only.
